+getMemory(): ConversationMemory
-runTool(step: AgentStep, workspace: Workspace): ToolResult
-buildRequest(workspace: Workspace): LlmRequest
-parseStep(text: String): AgentStep
--
the prompt lists the tools, the saved rules,
today and the dates of the next 7 days</panel_attributes>
